SDL-E1043 (spec/table.md)

  x malformed table relation header: the relation header needs its second arrow — write `table [<from>] -> <name> -> [<to>]`
   ,----
 1 | table user -> wrote { enforced; };
   :                    |
   :                    `-- malformed relation header
   `----
  help: a relation header is `table [<from> | …] -> <name> -> [<to> | …]` — both arrows are mandatory, the name always between them
